{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04562","headline":"代书答姜七崔九 · 张说","name":"代书答姜七崔九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"婀娜金闺树，离披野田草。\n虽殊两地荣，幸共三春好。\n花殊鸟飞处，叶镂虫行道。\n真心独感人，惆怅令人老。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04562.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04562","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}